<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose" style="max-width:760px">
    <p><strong>The short version:</strong> we collect information only when you choose to provide it, use limited analytics only after your consent, never sell or rent personal information, and take special care because our audience includes families.</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Made Out of Clay Productions is an independent children's picture-book imprint (pen name Isaiah Hartwell). You can reach us any time at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Your email address</strong> — when you subscribe to our newsletter. Newsletter subscriptions are managed by Beehiiv.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact-form information</strong> — your name, email, inquiry type, and message are processed by Web3Forms so we can receive and answer them.</li>
      <li><strong>Basic analytics</strong> — only after you accept our consent banner. We use Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, and Metricool to understand site use and campaign performance. Those services are not loaded until you consent.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical delivery data</strong> — Vercel and Cloudflare may process IP addresses, device details, and request logs as needed to host, secure, and deliver the website.</li>
      <li><strong>Your privacy choice</strong> — your browser stores whether you accepted or declined optional analytics so we can remember your selection.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We never sell, rent, or trade your information.</li>
      <li>We don't load analytics or advertising cookies until you opt in.</li>
      <li>We don't knowingly collect personal information from children. Our books are for kids, but our site and sign-ups are meant for the grown-ups who buy and read them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is intended to be used by adults (parents, caregivers, educators, librarians, press). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us information, email us and we will delete it promptly.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong> If you buy through an eligible link, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Unsubscribe from the newsletter any time using the link in any email.</li>
      <li>Decline analytics in the consent banner. If you previously accepted, clear this site's stored data to reset your choice.</li>
      <li>Ask us to access or delete your data by emailing <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as the site grows; we'll revise the date above when we do.</p>
